
  Arch Linux live + debootstrap  --  samsyu518/dotfiles

  Arch install   : archinstall  |  pacstrap /mnt base linux linux-firmware
  Debian install : debootstrap --arch=amd64 trixie /mnt https://deb.debian.org/debian

  Signatures are verified against /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg
  (debian-archive-keyring is preinstalled -- no --no-check-gpg needed).

  Reminder: after grub-install, confirm the firmware kept the NVRAM entry with
  `efibootmgr`. Some firmwares drop OS-created entries on the next boot; the
  fallback is to also place shim at \EFI\Microsoft\Boot\bootmgfw.efi.

